name jmb
category Package
revision 52718
shortdesc BibTeX style for the Journal of Theoretical Biology
longdesc This BibTeX bibliography style is for the Journal of Molecular
longdesc Biology and Journal of Theoretical Biology; the accompanying
longdesc LaTeX (2.09) package is a close relative of apalike.sty in the
longdesc BibTeX distribution; it features author-date references. The
longdesc bibliography style has control over whether to print reference
longdesc titles; if your database contains an article with the cite key
longdesc "TitlesOn", and you invoke it by \nocite{TitlesOn}, titles will
longdesc be printed; otherwise titles will not be printed.
